{"id": "t038-001", "text": "Ifeoma's mum is having her knee replaced on November 12th. Ifeoma is staying with her for the first week afterwards, and her brother Tunde takes over after that. She's worried her mum won't do the exercises properly. Remind me to text Ifeoma on the 13th to see how the operation went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ifeoma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her knee replaced", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ifeoma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first week afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after that", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Ifeoma", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ifeoma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 13th", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t038-003", "text": "Gemma and Damian got engaged in Lisbon over the weekend! He proposed at a tiny restaurant by the river. She's already talking about a spring wedding, maybe April 25th if the venue near her parents is free. Damian's mum has offered to make the cake, which Gemma is slightly nervous about. They're having a small engagement drinks thing next Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Damian", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got engaged in Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "April 25th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Damian", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t038-005", "text": "Rahul had his gallbladder out yesterday. He sounded groggy on the phone but said the nurses have been lovely. He hopes to be home by Thursday, but it depends on whether they're happy with his bloods. His wife is popping in every day and their son is driving down from Leeds this weekend to help out at home. He also said he's finally going to read the books I gave him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rahul", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had his gallbladder out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "groggy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "home", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "every day"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving down from Leeds", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t038-007", "text": "Don't forget to send Farah a card for her and Tunde's tenth anniversary. It's 6/18.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Farah a card for her and Tunde's tenth anniversary", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tenth anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6/18", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t038-012", "text": "Dinner with Yosef and his wife. Their twins start secondary school in September and they're touring schools every Saturday until then. He also said he's training for a half marathon in March and has joined a running club that meets on Sunday mornings. His wife thinks he's mad. I should send him that training plan I used.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "secondary school", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Saturday until then"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "half marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "running club", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday mornings"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that training plan I used", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t038-015", "text": "Zoe's grandad is in hospital with pneumonia. She's been visiting every evening after work and seems exhausted. I should drop round some food tomorrow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pneumonia", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening after work"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round some food", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t038-018", "text": "Alejandro is recovering well from his shoulder surgery. Physio twice a week for the next six weeks, and he can't drive until the end of January.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "shoulder surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "twice a week for the next six weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't drive", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the end of January"}]}
{"id": "t038-020", "text": "Esme has a hip replacement booked for December 3rd. She's been in pain for months, so honestly she's relieved. Her daughter Laila is taking time off to help, and the grandkids are coming over on Sundays. Esme said she wants to be walking properly by the time of her granddaughter's wedding in the spring. I should drop off some books and a puzzle before she goes in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "December 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in pain", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking time off", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandkids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sundays"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to be walking properly", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "granddaughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some books and a puzzle", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she goes in", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t038-021", "text": "Kiri and Anders are celebrating their silver wedding anniversary next Saturday with a party at the cricket club. They asked me to bring a dessert.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "silver wedding anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party at the cricket club", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t038-027", "text": "Joe is out of hospital! He was in for four nights after the appendix scare. He's back at his mum's to recover until next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "out of hospital", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "four nights"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appendix scare", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recover", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until next week", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t038-031", "text": "Yosef's daughter got into Oxford to study medicine. Remind me to send him a congratulations message tonight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into Oxford", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "study medicine", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a congratulations message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t038-035", "text": "Farah is allergic to shellfish and can't stand spicy food. Worth remembering for the anniversary dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to shellfish", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't stand spicy food", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t038-038", "text": "Santiago's mum is in for a hip operation on Monday and he's taking the week off to be with her. He looked worn out. Remind me to message him on Tuesday to see how she's doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip operation", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worn out", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t038-042", "text": "Alejandro proposed to Jess on her birthday, February 11th. They're thinking about a summer wedding next year in Spain.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "proposed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "February 11th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "summer", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next year", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t038-048", "text": "Dr Santos said Tunde's recovery is ahead of schedule. He's walking without the crutches now and is hoping to be back at work by November 1st.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Santos", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recovery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by November 1st", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t038-049", "text": "Ifeoma and her husband Anders are celebrating 5 years married on 9/30. She hinted that he's been wanting a decent record player, so maybe we can all chip in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ifeoma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "5 years married", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting a decent record player", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t038-052", "text": "Laila had her wisdom teeth out this morning. Her face is very swollen. Don't forget to check on her tomorrow afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had her wisdom teeth out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check on her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t038-057", "text": "Anders has his hernia operation on Thursday 7th. He's taking two weeks off. I'm feeding his fish while he's in hospital.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hernia operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday 7th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking two weeks off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fish", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "while he's in hospital", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t038-058", "text": "Kalani said her wedding to Santiago has been pushed back from June 10th to next spring, mostly because of her dad's chemo schedule. She seemed calmer about it than I expected. Remind me to ask her next week how her dad is getting on with the treatment.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from June 10th"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "to next spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chemo", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "calmer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}]}
